{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|skill|1","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"skill","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"判定不能（材料不足）です。診断したい文章が提示されていません。\n\n次の材料を送ってください。\n\n- 診断対象の文章（必須）\n- 元にしたメモや資料（Source Fidelityの判定に必要）\n- 普段の文章や文体サンプル（Voice Fidelityの判定に必要）\n\n受領後、以下の4軸を「問題なし／軽い懸念／要修正／判定不能」で診断し、根拠となる箇所を示します。\n\n- Source Fidelity：材料にない事実や解釈が増えていないか\n- Vocabulary Provenance：不自然な造語や無断の概念名がないか\n- Voice Fidelity：書き手らしい語彙・温度・リズムが残っているか\n- Writing Quality：反復、過剰整理、過剰説明などがないか","usage":{"input_tokens":21497,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":252,"reasoning_output_tokens":39},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T04:14:10.207Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T04:14:18.874Z","duration_ms":8667}
{"schema_version":1,"key":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material|control|1","case_id":"p31-diagnostic-needs-material","type":"diagnostic","condition":"control","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"診断対象の文章がまだありません。文章をそのまま貼り付けてください。\n\n以下の4軸で、各5点評価＋具体例＋改善案をお返しします。\n\n1. 言葉の自然さ  \n2. 個人的な視点・体験の濃さ  \n3. 表現や構成の均一さ（AIっぽさ）  \n4. 書き手らしい癖・個性の残り方","usage":{"input_tokens":26693,"cached_input_tokens":25728,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":290,"reasoning_output_tokens":47},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T04:14:08.845Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T04:14:23.327Z","duration_ms":14482}
